{
  "$comment": [
    "What each node on the canvas stands on. DECLARED, not discovered — we resolve",
    "statements the enterprise makes, we do not observe network traffic. That is why",
    "UNDECLARED exists as a verdict and why it means unknown, not safe.",
    "",
    "Three of these are deliberately wrong, and they fail in the three different ways",
    "that matter to an architect:",
    "  cards-tile     -> cards-core        catalogued, but deprecated and not for a channel.",
    "                                      The catalog names its successor, so the refusal",
    "                                      STATES the route to yes.",
    "  offers-tile    -> offers-engine     nobody catalogued it. The alternative has to be",
    "                                      inferred, and is labelled as a guess.",
    "  activity-tile  -> (nothing)         approved component, no declared capability.",
    "                                      Unknown, not safe."
  ],
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "screens": {
    "/dashboard": {
      "nodes": {
        "cards-tile": {
          "label": "Your cards",
          "role": "data-panel",
          "component": "@bank/ui/CardList@4.2",
          "capability": "api:default/cards-valid-for-user"
        },
        "balance-tile": {
          "label": "Balance",
          "role": "data-panel",
          "component": "@bank/ui/BalanceHero@2.1",
          "capability": "api:default/accounts-balance"
        },
        "offers-tile": {
          "label": "Offers for you",
          "role": "data-panel",
          "component": "@bank/ui/PromoCard@1.4",
          "capability": "api:default/offers-engine"
        },
        "activity-tile": {
          "label": "Recent activity",
          "role": "data-panel",
          "component": "@bank/ui/ActivityList@3.0",
          "capability": "api:default/offers-engine"
        },
        "greeting": {
          "label": "Good morning, {name}",
          "role": "display",
          "component": "@bank/ui/Heading@2.0",
          "capability": "api:default/identity-api"
        },
        "rate-calculator": {
          "label": "Repayment estimate",
          "role": "interactive",
          "component": "@bank/ui/Calculator@1.1",
          "capability": "none"
        },
        "hero-illustration": {
          "label": "Hero art",
          "role": "decoration",
          "component": null,
          "capability": null
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
